      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft to get you started on a professional and firm tone for the school board.\n\n\"I am writing to express my strong concerns regarding the proposed comprehensive sexuality education curriculum. I believe that the most sensitive and personal topics, such as these, should ultimately be determined by the parents in partnership with the family, not solely by the school district. I urge the board to prioritize a strong preference for community and family control over these essential ethical and personal discussions in our public education.\"\n\nRemember to tailor this to your specific local context and clearly state your position in the final version.",
